Rough week?

Ethereum Classic got its start in the worst summer crypto had seen.

June 2016: The DAO gets drained.
July 2016: Ethereum forks to undo it.
August 2016: Millions of $ETC from The DAO head for exchanges. Plenty expected the chain to die.

It didn’t.

Bad weeks are the ETC origin story.🍀

